  "verification": "All ordinary CPU windows exceed 100 GPU CPU ticks, use CDP midpoint brackets, keep process sets stable, qualify the recorded NVIDIA idle/window gates, verify actual encoder/draw/submit/canvas/device counts, and pass bright/dark pixel sanity checks. Per-canvas red-channel checksums match across accepted treatments; full RGBA equivalence was not verified. Separate traces have matched begin/end and one marker per observed page-frame.",
  "limits": [
    "Synthetic WebGPU workload; no Ghostty renderer, frame building, parser, terminal lifecycle, or production scheduler integration.",
    "Two instanced draws per canvas with per-canvas resource bundles; identical fixed instance data and animated uniform writes, no streaming glyph atlas work.",
    "Linux NVIDIA Vulkan Chromium headless-shell; rAF workload page frames are not physical display frames.",
    "CDP process CPU is coarse process-wide CPU in CLK_TCK units; no isolated render-thread measurement.",
    "GPU gate bounds foreign compute residency and utilization; it can miss short bursts and ordinary graphics activity.",
    "CommandBuffer::Flush duration is inclusive trace span duration, may overlap and is not self CPU time. Traced CPU is retained as context, excluded from ordinary CPU comparisons.",
    "Four paired repetitions provide bounded descriptive evidence, not production inference or statistical confidence.",
    "A acquires 17 GPUAdapter wrappers because Chromium consumes each wrapper; adapter creation is outside measurement.",
    "Production sharing would require leases/generation recovery and submission-before-callback semantics; existing renderer device destruction on disposal/construction failure/recovery is untouched.",
    "Readback pixelHash covers only each pixel red-channel byte; matching hashes establish a red-channel checksum match, not full RGBA equality. Captured measurement sources and original provenance remain unchanged.",
    "B→C groups per-canvas writeBuffer operations before the single submit; it does not isolate a fixed per-submit cost.",
    "Pair precedence is balanced, but A never occupies the middle within ABC/CBA/BCA/ACB treatment orders.",
    "trace-r2/B contains one 33.3 ms requestAnimationFrame gap.",
    "Recorded NVIDIA qualification permits stable 269 MiB foreign compute residency and does not establish uncontended graphics."
  ],
